  "notes": [
    "All p63–72 originals and p73 boundary were visually checked; p63 Unit07/Level3, p73 Unit08/Level3. No blank content page in this range.",
    "31 numbered + 14 independently headed unnumbered occurrences = 45. historian, vacant, onion and spinach are absent from the old MD list; retain book positions.",
    "trendy, attraction, history, historical, reminder, copilot, slavery, enslave, advice, advisory, summarize and sufficiency are explicit inline supplements, not independent headword blocks.",
    "necessary/necessarily are printed on p68; senior on p71; stack/mound/heap and steal on p72, not the older captures pages. a stack of... is explicit and retained.",
    "The printed crop second form appears copped on p69. Preserve it with a visible pending-decision note; do not silently replace it with cropped or map an inflection alias.",
    "Time and tide wait for no man and Necessity is the mother of invention are running example/proverb sentences, excluded. Arbitrary example words and reformulations of observe sentences are excluded.",
    "Only existing exact headwords or explicitly stored wordVariants are mapped; actual officialWord is preserved. No fuzzy or lemma mapping, new formal ID, sense ID, relation rule or master row."
  ]
